<Slide style={{
    background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #0F172A 0%, #1E3A8A 100%)',
    padding: '56px 56px 40px 56px',
}}>
    <Box style={{ height: '100%', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
                做了什么，下一步做什么
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.70)', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
                边界写清楚，比成果列得更长更有说服力
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 28 }} />

                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, flex: 1 }}>
            {[
                [
                    '已实现',
                    '#3B82F6',
                    [
                        '六层模块化单体，单进程部署，不引入容器与消息队列',
                        '八个业务节点链路，含修正回环与三条终态',
                        '语义层：7 个指标、6 张业务表、9 个维度',
                        '守卫九条规则，逐条有对应的测试覆盖',
                        '15 个 HTTP 接口，含流式对话与语义层调试接口',
                        '评测三组判据，一条命令重跑并输出报告',
                    ],
                ],
                [
                    '明确不做',
                    '#06B6D4',
                    [
                        '向量检索：登记表数量少，规则匹配已经够用',
                        '用户体系与鉴权：单机演示场景，无多角色需求',
                        '容器化部署：本地按说明即可启动',
                        '多租户与读写分离：没有对应的业务前提',
                    ],
                ],
                [
                    '后续演进',
                    '#06B6D4',
                    [
                        '换 PostgreSQL：单表超过 500 万行，或出现并发写入需求时',
                        '语义层改嵌入召回：登记表超过 30 张，规则匹配维护成本上升时',
                        '跨会话长期记忆：需要跨重启保留上下文时，检查点改 SQLite 实现',
                    ],
                ],
            ].map((col, ci) => (
                <Box key={ci} style={{
                    flex: 1,
                    background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.07)',
                    border: '1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16)',
                    borderRadius: 10,
                    padding: '20px 20px',
                    flexDirection: 'column',
                }}>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                        <Box style={{ width: 5, height: 22, background: col[1] }} />
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
                            {col[0]}
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ height: 16 }} />
                    {col[2].map((item, i) => (
                        <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, marginBottom: 12 }}>
                            <Box style={{
                                width: 6, height: 6, borderRadius: 3,
                                background: col[1], marginTop: 6,
                            }} />
                            <Text style={{
                                fontSize: 13.5, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.86)',
                                lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1, fontFamily: '微软雅黑',
                            }}>
                                {item}
                            </Text>
                        </Box>
                    ))}
                </Box>
            ))}
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ height: 20 }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.60)', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>
                Text2SQL 电商数据分析 Agent
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.60)', fontFamily: '微软雅黑' }}>12 / 12</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
